          "quote": "From +5V, a second diode D2 ... feeds a dedicated servo power rail backed by four 100 µF capacitors ... before reaching J3/J8 pin 2."
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The servo supply rail is grounded instead of being powered. This prevents the servos from receiving their intended supply and may create a short-circuit current path through D2 and the +5V source.",
      "confidence": 0.91
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic connects the D2-fed servo supply rail to GND. This contradicts the specified isolated servo power rail and would prevent normal servo operation, with potential for excessive supply current."
}

